CM unit 3a: the stream splitter closes the first structure at NXQ, and the
CM echo then re-reads that line as a card and refuses its mnemonic - Python
CM reports it through the last line of defence; so does the C++ printout.
CE
GW 1,11,0.,-.25,0.,0.,.25,0.,.0005
GE 0,-1
FR 0,1,0,0,299.7925
GN -1
EX 4,1,6,0,1.414214,0.
PQ 0
XQ 0
NXQ 1
CM second structure
CE
GW 1,11,0.,-.25,0.,0.,.25,0.,.0005
GE 0,-1
FR 0,1,0,0,299.7925
GN -1
EX 4,1,6,0,1.414214,0.
XQ 0
